OL,3,GNEWSAAdmiral insurance firm to cut 500
OL,4,Ajobs in the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FInsurer Admiral will cut 500 jobs in
OL,7,Fthe UK as part of plans to save #100m,
OL,8,Fit has announced.
OL,10,FThe proposals are related to Admiral's
OL,11,FUK insurance business only, and will
OL,12,Faffect about 5% of its workforce.
OL,14,F"We recognise this will be a difficult
OL,15,Ftime for affected colleagues," said
OL,16,FAlistair Hargreaves, Admiral Insurance
OL,17,FUK's chief executive.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
